Searching for AV equipment consultations mostly turns up generic checklists, "questions to ask your AV vendor" listicles that read the same for a wedding as for a product launch. That is not the actual decision most people are stuck on before they book with us. The real question is narrower: which of our 5 fixed packages fits your specific event, before we deliver a single speaker.

Our [how to customize AV rental packages](/blog/how-to-customize-av-rental-packages/) guide already covers what happens after you have chosen one, the priced add on list. This page is the step before that: how to land on the right package in the first place, using the same guest counts, event types and technician rules that already live in our own catalog, just never assembled in one place until now.

[Contact us](/contact/) with your event date, guest count and venue, and we will tell you honestly which package fits, no charge for asking.

