## How Far in Advance to Book

All our bookings need at least 24 hours' notice, and that applies to the consultation itself as much as the equipment: the earlier you tell us your event date, guest count and venue, the more room we have to match you to the right package and confirm technician availability if you need one. If your event lands during wedding season, April through October, or during the conference season on the Costa del Sol, reach out as early as you can, since technician covered packages and larger MICE Pack bookings fill first during those stretches.

## Conclusion

Choosing the right AV package comes down to 3 real inputs: your guest count, your event type, and whether you want a technician on site, with venue mostly shaping the details once those 3 point you to a package. Asking us to help with that costs nothing on its own, every price in our catalog already covers delivery, setup and testing. [Contact us](/contact/) with your event date, guest count and venue, and we will tell you honestly which of our 5 packages fits. For the full equipment range behind every package on this page, see the [audio visual rental in Malaga guide](/blog/audio-visual-rental/).

## FAQs

### Which package is right for my event?

It depends mainly on your guest count and event type: the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) for a party up to 50 guests, the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) for a meeting up to 40 guests, the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) for a presentation, dealership showcase or product launch regardless of headcount, the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) for a larger corporate event up to 120 guests, and the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) for a wedding up to 80 guests. See [The Package to Event Decision Table](#the-package-to-event-decision-table) above for the full breakdown.

### What information do you need to help me choose?

Your event date, your venue location, your expected guest count, and the type of equipment or package you are interested in, even if that is just a description of the event rather than a package name. See [What Information We Need From You](#what-information-we-need-from-you) above.

### Is the consultation free?

Yes. Asking which package fits your event costs nothing on its own, every package price already covers delivery, setup and testing, and there is no separate fee anywhere in our pricing for the conversation that gets you there. See [Is a Consultation Free](#is-a-consultation-free) above.

### Do I need a technician included, or can I run the equipment myself?

That depends on how much attention you want free during your event, not a fixed rule. Our AV technician hire guide has the full package by package breakdown, and our [AV system troubleshooting](/blog/av-system-troubleshooting/) guide covers what to check yourself on the 3 packages with no technician on site. See [Do You Need a Technician, or Can You Run It Yourself](#do-you-need-a-technician-or-can-you-run-it-yourself) above.

### My guest count falls between two packages, which should I pick?

Lean on event type, not the exact headcount. A party a few guests over the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/)'s 50 guest cap is rarely a problem. A corporate meeting a few guests over the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/)'s 40 guest cap is a signal to step up to the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) rather than round down. See [When Your Guest Count Falls Between Two Packages](#when-your-guest-count-falls-between-two-packages) above.

### Why doesn't the Product Presentation Pack list a guest count?

Because it is chosen by what your event is, a corporate presentation, dealership showcase, or product launch, rather than by how many people attend. Its projector, screen and single wireless microphone work the same way whether 15 or 45 guests are watching. See [Why the Product Presentation Pack Has No Guest Cap](#why-the-product-presentation-pack-has-no-guest-cap) above.

### What's the real difference between the Basic MICE Pack and the MICE Pack?

Beyond the guest cap, 40 against 120, the real difference is what is standard: the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes a technician for up to 6 continuous hours and a 60 inch LED display as standard, while the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers a technician only as a 240 euro per day add on. See [Basic MICE Pack vs MICE Pack](#basic-mice-pack-vs-mice-pack-the-real-difference) above.

### Does my venue affect which package I should choose?

Rarely on its own. Guest count and event type decide the package first, venue mostly shapes what we plan around afterward, cable runs and weather exposure outdoors, or AV restrictions at a hotel ballroom. See [Does Your Venue Change Which Package You Need](#does-your-venue-change-which-package-you-need) above.

### How far in advance should I book my consultation?

As early as you can once your event date is set. Bookings need at least 24 hours' notice at minimum, and reaching out earlier gives us more room to confirm the right package and technician availability, especially during wedding season from April through October. See [How Far in Advance to Book](#how-far-in-advance-to-book) above.

### Can I customize a package after I've already booked it?

Yes. Every package can be extended with priced add ons, projectors and screens, extra microphones, premium lecterns, staging, and additional technician hours. Our [how to customize AV rental packages](/blog/how-to-customize-av-rental-packages/) guide has the full priced list.

### What if I'm not sure what I need at all?

Describe your event rather than trying to guess a package name. Tell us your event date, guest count, venue and what kind of event it is, a party, a meeting, a presentation, or a wedding, and we will match it to one of our 5 packages for you. [Contact us](/contact/) and start from the event, not the catalog.
